title: "Desk-based assessment of urban vascular plant biodiversity in Piedmont, Italy"
abstract: >-
  Checklists and occurrence data of the urban vascular flora of the eight
  provincial capitals of Piedmont (Alessandria, Asti, Biella, Cuneo, Novara,
  Torino, Verbania, Vercelli), with reproducible R workflows and GBIF download
  provenance.
